Font notices for awesome-signature-tools / 在线免费生成电子签名
================================================================

This project **self-hosts** OFL font binaries (woff2) under `public/fonts/`.
They are loaded at runtime via the FontFace API from the same origin
(relative to the Vite `base` path). No Google Fonts / fonts.loli.net /
fonts.font.im (or other third-party) stylesheet is fetched in the browser.

Binaries are **SIL Open Font License (OFL) 1.1** chinese-simplified subsets
packaged by Fontsource from the official Google Fonts OFL sources.

