Versions / packaging
--------------------
- Subset flavor: Fontsource `chinese-simplified` woff2 (covers common
  Simplified Chinese glyphs used for names/UI; rare characters may fall back).
- Refresh binaries: `node scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs`
- Per-family OFL text copies: `fonts/licenses/OFL-*.txt`

Additional visual styles (立体字 / 刀锋体 / 创意签 / 描边签 /
印章红 / 霓虹签 / 网红签 etc.) are produced by Canvas drawing
effects on top of the open fonts above — no proprietary commercial
signature fonts are downloaded, mirrored, or embedded.

